state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks. Layout, grouping, emphasis and styling are your decisions.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"46\" />\n        <frame id=\"2:20\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"120\" width=\"1288\" height=\"181\">\n          <text id=\"2:21\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"79\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:22\" name=\"Goal: brand recognition while the app loads.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:23\" name=\"Must include: • Brand: Foodgo wordmark • Media: Splash_Burger_Stack\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"69\" />\n          <text id=\"2:24\" name=\"Links: auto-advances to 02_Home.\" x=\"20\" y=\"144\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"2:25\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"323\" width=\"1288\" height=\"273\">\n          <text id=\"2:26\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"73\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:27\" name=\"Goal: find a burger fast — by search, category or browsing.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:28\" name=\"Must include: • Account: avatar • Brand: Foodgo wordmark · “Order your favourite food!” • Categories: All / Combos / Sliders / Classic · current: All • Main navigation: current tab Home · Add entry • Menu: 4 items, each with image, category, name, rating and favourite toggle · Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger is a favourite • Search &amp; filter: search “Search” · filter entry\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"161\" />\n          <text id=\"2:29\" name=\"Links: each menu item → its product frame (03–06); Profile tab → 10_Profile; Support tab → 11_Support_Chat.\" x=\"20\" y=\"236\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"2:30\" name=\"03–06_Product_* (4 frames, same structure)\" x=\"0\" y=\"618\" width=\"1288\" height=\"273\">\n          <text id=\"2:31\" name=\"03–06_Product_* (4 frames, same structure)\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"341\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:32\" name=\"Goal: judge a burger and choose spice level and portions before ordering.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:33\" name=\"Must include: • Actions: back · search · Order Now • Burger: image · full name · rating · preparation time · description • Portion: current portion, can be decreased / increased • Price: price for the current portion • Spicy: level from Mild to Hot · current level Data per burger: see DATA.\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"161\" />\n          <text id=\"2:34\" name=\"Links: back → 02_Home; Order Now on 03_Product_Cheeseburger → 07_Customize (Order Now on 04–06 is entry only).\" x=\"20\" y=\"236\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"2:35\" name=\"07_Customize\" x=\"0\" y=\"913\" width=\"1288\" height=\"319\">\n          <text id=\"2:36\" name=\"07_Customize\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"109\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:37\" name=\"Goal: personalize the Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger and see the total before paying.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:38\" name=\"Must include: • Actions: back · search · Order Now • Add-ons: “Toppings” Tomato, Onions, Pickles, Bacon, Cheese, Mushroom, Avocado · “Side options” Fries, Coleslaw, Salad, Onion Rings, Mozzarella Sticks · each can be added or removed · added: Tomato, Cheese, Fries • Copy: “Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience” • Media: Burger_Exploded_Custom • Portion: 2, can be decreased / increased • Spicy: level from Mild to Hot · current level • Total: $16.48\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"207\" />\n          <text id=\"2:39\" name=\"Links: back → 03_Product_Cheeseburger; Order Now → 08_Payment.\" x=\"20\" y=\"282\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"2:40\" name=\"08_Payment\" x=\"0\" y=\"1254\" width=\"1288\" height=\"250\">\n          <text id=\"2:41\" name=\"08_Payment\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"95\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:42\" name=\"Goal: verify the order cost and pay with a saved card.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:43\" name=\"Must include: • Actions: back · search · Pay Now • Order summary: “Order summary” · Order $16.48 · Taxes $0.30 · Delivery fees $1.50 · Total $18.28 · Estimated delivery time 15–30 mins • Payment methods: “Payment methods” · Credit card (Mastercard, 5105 **** **** 0505) · Debit card (Visa, 3566 **** **** 0505) · only one can be chosen · current: Credit card • Save card: “Save card details for future payments” · on • Total price: $18.28\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"138\" />\n          <text id=\"2:44\" name=\"Links: back → 07_Customize; Pay Now → 09_Payment_Success_Overlay.\" x=\"20\" y=\"213\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"2:45\" name=\"09_Payment_Success_Overlay\" x=\"0\" y=\"1526\" width=\"1288\" height=\"227\">\n          <text id=\"2:46\" name=\"09_Payment_Success_Overlay\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"232\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:47\" name=\"Goal: confirm the payment unambiguously.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:48\" name=\"Must include: • Actions: Go Back • Copy: “Success!” · “Your payment was successful. A receipt for this purchase has been sent to your email.” • Presentation: dialog over 08_Payment; Payment stays behind it • Status: success mark\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"115\" />\n          <text id=\"2:49\" name=\"Links: Go Back → 02_Home.\" x=\"20\" y=\"190\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"2:50\" name=\"10_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"1775\" width=\"1288\" height=\"204\">\n          <text id=\"2:51\" name=\"10_Profile\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"78\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:52\" name=\"Goal: review account details and reach account actions.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:53\" name=\"Must include: • Account: avatar · Delivery address 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY · Email sophiapatel@gmail.com · Name Sophia Patel · Password (masked, locked) • Actions: back · settings · Edit Profile · Log out • Entries: Order history · Payment Details\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"92\" />\n          <text id=\"2:54\" name=\"Links: back → 02_Home.\" x=\"20\" y=\"167\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"2:55\" name=\"11_Support_Chat\" x=\"0\" y=\"2001\" width=\"1288\" height=\"204\">\n          <text id=\"2:56\" name=\"11_Support_Chat\" x=\"20\" y=\"14\" width=\"132\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"2:57\" name=\"Goal: get a delivery update from support.\" x=\"20\" y=\"44\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"2:58\" name=\"Must include: • Actions: back · menu · send • Conversation: 7 items in the order given in DATA — each message from the agent or the customer · timestamp “26 minutes ago” after the agent’s third message • Input: “Type here...”\" x=\"20\" y=\"71\" width=\"1248\" height=\"92\" />\n          <text id=\"2:59\" name=\"Links: back → 02_Home.\" x=\"20\" y=\"167\" width=\"1248\" height=\"23\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n      <frame id=\"2:60\" name=\"STRUCTURE (FIXED)\" x=\"56\" y=\"2689\" width=\"1288\" height=\"156\">\n        <text id=\"2:61\" name=\"STRUCTURE (FIXED)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"186\" height=\"30\" />\n        <text id=\"2:62\" name=\"Main navigation on 02_Home — in this order: Home → 02 · Profile → 10 · Support → 11 · Favourites (entry only), plus a central Add (entry only). The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours.\" x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"1288\" height=\"48\" />\n        <text id=\"2:63\" name=\"Order flow: Home → Product → Customize → Payment → Success dialog (over Payment) → Home. Product, Customize, Payment, Profile and Support use back navigation.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:64\" name=\"Entry-only (no screen required): search, filter, Combos / Sliders / Classic results, settings, menu, Payment Details, Order history, Edit Profile, Log out, Order Now on 04–06.\" x=\"0\" y=\"132\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n      </frame>\n      <frame id=\"2:65\" name=\"DATA &amp; COPY (FIXED)\" x=\"56\" y=\"2885\" width=\"1288\" height=\"486\">\n        <text id=\"2:66\" name=\"DATA &amp; COPY (FIXED)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"198\" height=\"30\" />\n        <text id=\"2:67\" name=\"Customer: Sophia Patel · sophiapatel@gmail.com · 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY. Use Avatar_Neutral wherever the customer appears.\" x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:68\" name=\"Menu (category · name · rating · time · price per portion → portion shown on its product frame = price shown):\" x=\"0\" y=\"74\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:69\" name=\"Cheeseburger · Wendy’s Burger · 4.9 · 26 mins · $8.24 → portion 1 = $8.24 · Hamburger · Veggie Burger · 4.8 · 14 mins · $9.99 → portion 1 = $9.99\" x=\"0\" y=\"108\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:70\" name=\"Hamburger · Chicken Burger · 4.6 · 42 mins · $6.24 → portion 2 = $12.48 · Hamburger · Fried Chicken Burger · 4.5 · 14 mins · $6.75 → portion 4 = $27.00\" x=\"0\" y=\"142\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:71\" name=\"Descriptions — Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger: “A classic fast food burger that packs a punch of flavor in every bite: a juicy beef patty cooked to perfection, topped with melted American cheese, crispy lettuce, ripe tomato and crunchy pickles.”\" x=\"0\" y=\"176\" width=\"1288\" height=\"48\" />\n        <text id=\"2:72\" name=\"Veggie: “A savory blend of fresh vegetables and herbs, topped with crisp lettuce, juicy tomatoes and tangy pickles, served on a soft, toasted bun.”\" x=\"0\" y=\"234\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:73\" name=\"Chicken: “A delicious and healthier alternative to traditional beef burgers, perfect for a lighter meal.”\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:74\" name=\"Fried Chicken: “A juicy chicken patty, hand-breaded and deep-fried to perfection, served on a warm bun with lettuce, tomato and a creamy sauce.”\" x=\"0\" y=\"302\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:75\" name=\"Customize: add-ons are included at no extra cost; Total = 2 × $8.24 = $16.48. Payment: $16.48 + $0.30 + $1.50 = $18.28 (same total in summary and at Pay Now).\" x=\"0\" y=\"336\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:76\" name=\"Chat (A = agent, C = customer): A “Hi, how can I help you?” · C “Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?” · A “Ok, please let me check!” · C “Sure...” ·\" x=\"0\" y=\"370\" width=\"1288\" height=\"48\" />\n        <text id=\"2:77\" name=\"A “It’ll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.” · [26 minutes ago] · C “Ok, thank you for your support.”\" x=\"0\" y=\"428\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:78\" name=\"The source file has inconsistent totals ($16.49 / $18.19), a mismatched order in chat and typos (“Bacons”, “thanks you”). Follow this brief, not the source.\" x=\"0\" y=\"462\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n      </frame>\n      <frame id=\"2:79\" name=\"HANDOFF &amp; EVALUATION\" x=\"56\" y=\"3411\" width=\"1288\" height=\"190\">\n        <text id=\"2:80\" name=\"HANDOFF &amp; EVALUATION\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"233\" height=\"30\" />\n        <text id=\"2:81\" name=\"Copy Components and Media into your own new Figma file; do not edit, rename or delete anything in this starter file.\" x=\"0\" y=\"40\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:82\" name=\"Deliver all 11 frames with the exact names above, prototype links as listed, and your own reusable components. Submit your file link.\" x=\"0\" y=\"74\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n        <text id=\"2:83\" name=\"Evaluated: (1) checklist coverage per frame · (2) data &amp; copy accuracy · (3) flow &amp; prototype completeness · (4) information hierarchy · (5) visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system · (6) component reuse · (7) state design.\" x=\"0\" y=\"108\" width=\"1288\" height=\"48\" />\n        <text id=\"2:84\" name=\"The completed reference screens are withheld. There is no single correct layout.\" x=\"0\" y=\"166\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"15f9dfda-9420-4b2e-af5d-31e06d8e1dc2"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_6bd7689a397c4cd9ba2c7124","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
