{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_5fb8894693724047bdbcc742","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"1:4\" name=\"04 · Media 素材库\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"1:178\" name=\"Media Library\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"2322\">\n    <frame id=\"1:179\" name=\"Header\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"172\">\n      <text id=\"1:180\" name=\"FOODGO / MEDIA LIBRARY\" x=\"56\" y=\"48\" width=\"195\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"1:181\" name=\"Copy any named asset into your own file.\" x=\"56\" y=\"79\" width=\"700\" height=\"45\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"1:182\" name=\"Body\" x=\"0\" y=\"172\" width=\"1400\" height=\"2150\">\n      <frame id=\"1:183\" name=\"Media Guide\" x=\"56\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"151\">\n        <text id=\"1:184\" name=\"MEDIA GUIDE\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"111\" height=\"21\" />\n        <text id=\"1:185\" name=\"• Food images are transparent PNGs at original resolution: use Fit, keep proportions, never stretch. Background treatment around them is your decision.\" x=\"0\" y=\"29\" width=\"1288\" height=\"18\" />\n        <text id=\"1:186\" name=\"• The same product always uses the same image (e.g. Burger_Cheeseburger_Wendys on Home and on its product frame).\" x=\"0\" y=\"55\" width=\"1288\" height=\"18\" />\n        <text id=\"1:187\" name=\"• Icons are editable vector components — recolor them to your palette. Plus / Minus / Check / Menu are simple line glyphs added for completeness.\" x=\"0\" y=\"81\" width=\"1288\" height=\"18\" />\n        <text id=\"1:188\" name=\"• Foodgo_Wordmark is the outlined Lobster logotype; supplied in Dark and White. Do not re-type or distort it.\" x=\"0\" y=\"107\" width=\"1288\" height=\"18\" />\n        <text id=\"1:189\" name=\"• Source person photos are excluded; use Avatar_Neutral for Sophia Patel. This library is a catalogue only — its arrangement does not suggest any layo