or reuse): Button = fill #EF2A39, radius 20, 200×64, H autolayout pad [0,32,0,32], label Roboto SemiBold 18 #FFFFFF; Text Field = V autolayout gap 6, label Roboto Medium 14 #808080, field 56 tall radius 12 stroke #E2E2E2, value Roboto Regular 18 #B3B3B3.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No tool errors occurred; every call returned successfully.\n   - Judgment issue resolved: `whoami` shows the MCP-authenticated seat belongs to \"gaoyongyong's team\" (View) while the file lives in \"Sensenova design\" (Full). Per the rule not to switch accounts/teams and to use the configured account, I continued with the current identity; file access worked fine.\n   - Instruction conflict resolved: the brief's handoff note says \"copy components/media into your own new Figma file,\" but the harness explicitly overrides this — delivery is the `03 · Workspace` page inside the assigned copy. I am copying assets into 2006:2 and building there.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Confirmed all five pages exist and that 2006:2 is empty, so the whole design (frames + components + prototypes) must be created from scratch in that page.\n   - Established an asset strategy: clone all 43 source components (UI components, wordmarks, food photos, icons) into a `_Library Assets` frame (id 2008:156) once, then reference them by ID while assembling screens — this satisfies \"reuse the components\" without re-uploading images.\n   - Captured the full asset ID map (see Current Work) needed for all subsequent build calls.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计: Figma 文件:https://www.figma.com/design/w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n   - (Final turn) A system-level instruction to respond with TEXT ONLY and produce this conversation summary, without calling any tools.\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Build all 11 frames with the exact required names in page 2006:2 (430 × 932 base viewport).\n   - Create own reusable business components (bottom navigation, menu item card, back header, category chip, add-on/side option row, payment method row, chat bubble, etc.) and use them consistently.\n   - Place Status Bar (2008:8) and Home Indicator (2008:19) on every frame.\n   - Reproduce all fixed copy/data accurately (prices, ratings, times, descriptions, chat order, \"26 minutes ago\").\n   - Add the prototype reactions listed in the brief.\n   - Screenshot every required screen, fix visible issues, then report file URL, page ID, frame IDs, prototype work, and limitations.\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Immediately before this summary request, I had just completed the asset-preparation step in page `2006:2`: loaded fonts (Inter Semi Bold; Roboto Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold) and cloned the 43 source components into a new frame `_Library Assets` (id `2008:156`) positioned at (0, 1200), 1000×600, fill #F5F5F5. The tool returned this asset ID map, which is the foundation for all frame construction:\n   - Button default `2008:2`; Text Field `2008:4`; Status Bar `2008:8`; Home Indicator `2008:19`\n   - Wordmark Dark `2008:21`; Wordmark White `2008:23`; Avatar_Neutral `2008:25`\n   - Burger_Cheeseburger_Wendys `2008:28`, Burger_Veggie `2008:29`, Burger_Chicken `2008:30`, Burger_Fried_Chicken `2008:31`, Burger_Exploded_Custom `2008:32`\n   - Toppings: Tomato `2008:33`, Onions `2008:34`, Pickles `2008:35`, Bacon `2008:36`, Cheese `2008:37`, Mushroom `2008:38`, Avocado `2008:39`\n   - Sides: Fries `2008:40`, Coleslaw `2008:41`, Salad `2008:42`, Onion_Rings `2008:43`, Mozzarella_Sticks `2008:44`\n   - Card_Mastercard `2008:45`, Card_Visa `2008:46`\n   - Icons: Home `2008:47`, User `2008:53`, Chat `2008:60`, Heart `2008:67`, Search `2008:74`, Filter `2008:82`, Back `2008:91`, ChevronRight `2008:95`, Star `2008:100`, Settings `2008:106`, Lock `2008:111`, Edit `2008:116`, SignOut `2008:127`, Send `2008:137`, Plus `2008:145`, Minus `2008:148`, Check `2008:150`, Menu `2008:153`\n\n   My stated plan at that point: \"Reasoning summary: 已掌握源组件结构（默认按钮 #EF2A39/r20/64高、文本框、状态栏、Home Indicator）。现在执行第 1 步：加载字体并把源组件与全部图片/图标素材复制到 03·Workspace 页面，建立可复用资产库并返回其 ID。\"\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Create the first screens in page 2006:2 — starting with `01_Splash` (wordmark + Splash_Burger_Stack, auto-advance to Home) and `02_Home` (header with avatar + wordmark + \"Order your favourite food!\", search field + filter entry, category chips All/Combos/Sliders/Classic with All current, 4 menu items with image/category/name/rating/favourite toggle where Wendy's Burger is favourited, and the fixed bottom navigation Home → Profile → Support → Favourites with central Add) — placing Status Bar `2008:8` and Home Indicator `2008:19` on each, and building my own reusable components (BottomNav, MenuItemCard, CategoryChip, etc.) as I go.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/gaoyongyong/code/rate_website_figma-sft-cc-tap-benchmark-design/storage/benchmarks/3case-7models-v4-20261028/runs/TEST-013_1793204123667/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-gaoyongyong-code-rate-website-figma-sft-cc-tap-benchmark-design-storage-benchmarks-3case-7models-v4-20261028-workspace/3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a","uuid":"0e39d796-0ee7-4cb3-a7fd-5ead60bc0e71","timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:22: