{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user (single Chinese-language request) asked to complete the full design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR/ (fileKey `w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR`): read the task in 「00·Start Here」, follow the visual spec in 「01·Foundations」, reuse components from 「02·Components」, use assets from 「04·Media」, and deliver the complete design into 「03·Workspace」.\n\n   Harness constraints still in force: confirm the account via whoami before writing (must be gaoyongyong@tetras.ai); use only the assigned file; read reference pages before writing; create all work inside page 2006:2 (create if missing) and preserve existing reference pages; do not create another Figma file or switch accounts/teams; build in manageable sections and check tool results before continuing; add prototype interactions after the relevant screens exist; inspect screenshots of all required screens and fix visible problems; finish with the file URL, the 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and any remaining limitations; do not claim completion for unfinished work. Every tool call must be preceded in the same assistant message by a visible summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; the final response must start with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:`.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma MCP tools: `whoami`, `get_metadata` (only works on `/design/` pages), `use_figma` (JavaScript against the Plugin API), `get_screenshot`.\n   - Plugin API: `figma.setCurrentPageAsync`, `figma.getNodeByIdAsync`, `node.clone()`, `figma.createComponentFromNode`, `createInstance`, `rescale`, `findOne`/`findAll`, `figma.loadFontAsync`.\n   - Critical type distinction discovered: food/brand images in `_Library Assets` are **RECTANGLE** clones, not COMPONENTs → must be `.clone()`d, not `.createInstance()`d.\n   - Auto-layout patterns: `layoutMode`, `itemSpacing`, padding, `primaryAxisSizingMode`/`counterAxisSizingMode`, `layoutAlign='STRETCH'`, `layoutGrow=1`, `layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'` for pinned bottom bars/nav.\n   - Design tokens in use: RED #EF2A39, INK #3C2F2F, SUB #8C8282, BG #FDF9F7, GOLD #F5A623, stroke #EAE4E1, pill #F2EDEA, rating bg #FFF1F0. Viewport 430×932.\n   - Fonts: Roboto Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold for all UI text; Lobster reserved for the supplied wordmark components.\n   - Helper functions reused across calls: `hex`, `S(hex,opacity)`, `T(text,size,weight,color)`, `AF(name,dir,gap,pad)`, `tint(node,hex)`, `icon(id,size,hex)`, `img(id,size,fillHex,radius)`, `inst(id)`.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   This task writes to a Figma file, not local files. Key Figma artifacts created/used in page `2006:2`:\n   - `_Library Assets` frame `2008:156` — 43 cloned source assets. Component IDs: Button `2008:2` (200×64, #EF2A39, r20, label Roboto SemiBold 18 white, child text name \"Label\"), Text Field `2008:4`, Status Bar `2008:8` (430×44), Home Indicator `2008:19` (430×34), Wordmark Dark `2008:21` (171×60), Wordmark White `2008:23`, Avatar_Neutral `2008:25` (120×120). Rectangle image IDs: Burger_Cheeseburger_Wendys `2008:28` (177×180), Burger_Veggie `2008:29`, Burger_Chicken `2008:30`, Burger_Fried_Chicken `2008:31`, Burger_Exploded_Custom `2008:32`, Toppings `2008:33–2008:39` (Tomato, Onions, Pickles, Bacon, Cheese, Mushroom, Avocado), Sides `2008:40–2008:44` (Fries, Coleslaw, Salad, Onion_Rings, Mozzarella_Sticks), Card_Mastercard `2008:45`, Card_Visa `2008:46`. Icon COMPONENTs (24×24): Home `2008:47`, User `2008:53`, Chat `2008:60`, Heart `2008:67`, Search `2008:74`, Filter `2008:82`, Back `2008:91`, ChevronRight `2008:95`, Star `2008:100`, Settings `2008:106`, Lock `2008:111`, Edit `2008:116`, SignOut `2008:127`, Send `2008:137`, Plus `2008:145`, Minus `2008:148`, Check `2008:150`, Menu `2008:153`. **No Splash_Burger_Stack asset exists in the library.**\n   - New reusable components created this session: `BottomNav / Home` `2009:42`, `BottomNav / Profile` `2009:83`, `BottomNav / Support` `2009:124` (430×76, tabs Home/Profile/Support/Favourites + central red Add button), `Rating` `2009:133` (children[0]=star icon, children[1]=text, so `rating.children[1].characters=rate`), `AddOnItem` `2009:141` (165×60 chip: thumb frame, label, plus toggle).\n   - Frames built: `01_Splash` `2012:84` (x=0), `02_Home` `2012:114` (x=530), `03_Product_Cheeseburger` `2013:225` (x=1060), `04_Product_Veggie` `2016:262` (x=1590), `05_Product_Chicken` `2016:337` (x=2120), `06_Product_Fried_Chicken` `2016:412` (x=2650).\n   - 03 product page text node IDs (useful for edits): title `2013:257`, price `2013:258`, rating text `I2013:262;2009:132`, time `2013:277`, description `2013:278` (name \"desc\", lineHeight 20px), tags `2013:281/283/285`, qty `2013:291`, button label `I2013:296;2008:3`; product image rect `2013:255`.\n   - Last executed code (clone-based product screens, succeeded):\n     ```js\n     await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2006:2'));\n     const hex2=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255});\n     for(const n of figma.currentPage.children.slice()){if(['04_Product_Veggie','05_Product_Chicken','06_Product_Fried_Chicken'].indexOf(n.name)>=0)n.remove();}\n     for(const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style:s});\n     const src=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2013:225');\n     // per item: clone, set name/x, recolor image rect, rescale to 176, then:\n     const set=(needle,val)=>{const n=f.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'&&x.characters.indexOf(needle)===0);if(n)n.characters=val;return n;};\n     set('Wendy’s Burger',d.title); set('$8.24','$'+d.price); set('Order Now','Order Now · $'+d.price);\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - `set_fontSize ... Expected number, received string`: I passed `'16'` as a string in `T('Hungry? Bite into Happiness.','16',...)`. Fixed by passing `16` and deleting/recreating the partial `01_Splash` frame before the retry.\n   - `node.createInstance: no such property 'createInstance' on RECTANGLE node`: I tried `inst('1:204')` assuming a Splash_Burger_Stack component. Investigation showed `1:4` is the images page (not components) and no Splash asset exists in `_Library Assets`; all food images are RECTANGLEs. Fixed by adding an `img()` helper that clones the rectangle, applies a solid fill, rescales, and sets cornerRadius; Splash now uses a brand icon medallion + white wordmark instead of a burger photo.\n   - `Cannot write to node with unloaded font \"Roboto Bold\"`: the clone/replace call did not load fonts. Fixed by loading Roboto Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold before editing text.\n   - `cannot set property 'characters' of null`: overly fragile `findOne` predicates matched the wrong nodes. Fixed by dumping 03's text nodes to get exact IDs/contents, then using `characters.indexOf(needle)===0` for the title, `characters==='$8.24'` for the price, `set('Order Now', ...)` for the button label, and exact equality for `'4.9'` / `'26 mins'`; partial clones were removed before rebuilding.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Established that 04·Media (1:4) is an image-only page not readable via get_metadata; reused the already-cloned 43 assets in `_Library Assets` as the sole asset source.\n   - Confirmed image assets are rectangles, so a clone+recolor path (`img()`) replaced instantiation everywhere.\n   - Resolved the missing Splash_Burger_Stack by substituting a brand medallion (white 16% circle + white chevron icon) plus the white wordmark — flagged as a known deviation to report.\n   - Two visual polish items noted from screenshots but not yet fixed: (a) the chevron icon inside the Splash circle sits slightly right of centre; (b) Home menu-card rows are slightly cramped below the wrapped description text.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计: Figma 文件:https://www.figma.com/design/w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n   - (Final turn) A system-level instruction to respond with TEXT ONLY and produce this summary without calling tools.\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Build the remaining 5 frames with exact names: `07_Customize`, `08_Payment`, `09_Payment_Success_Overlay`, `10_Profile`, `11_Support_Chat` (430×932, status bar + home indicator on each).\n   - Reproduce fixed data: Customize add-ons Tomato/Cheese/Fries, copy \"Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience\", Total 2 × $8.24 = $16.48; Payment Order $16.48 / Taxes $0.30 / Delivery fees $1.50 / Total $18.28 / ETA 15–30 mins, Mastercard 5105 **** **** 0505 selected, Visa 3566 **** **** 0505 unselected, \"Save card details for future payments\" on; Profile Sophia Patel, sophiapatel@gmail.com, 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY, masked+locked password, Edit Profile / Log out / Order history / Payment Details / settings; Chat's 7 messages in order including \"26 minutes ago\".\n   - Apply the two noted polish fixes (Splash icon centering, Home card row spacing).\n   - Add prototype reactions: Splash→Home (auto); Home items→03–06; Home Profile tab→10, Support tab→11; product back→Home; 03 Order Now→07; 07 back→03, Order Now→08; 08 back→07, Pay Now→09; 09 Go Back→Home; 10 back→Home; 11 back→Home.\n   - Screenshot all required screens, then report file URL, page ID 2006:2, frame IDs, prototype work, and limitations.\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Immediately before the summary request, the last tool call successfully cloned `03_Product_Cheeseburger` (2013:225) three times and re-themed each, returning:\n   `[{\"id\":\"2016:262\",\"name\":\"04_Product_Veggie\",\"imgW\":173,\"imgH\":176},{\"id\":\"2016:337\",\"name\":\"05_Product_Chicken\",...},{\"id\":\"2016:412\",\"name\":\"06_Product_Fried_Chicken\",...}]`\n   Applied per-screen data: Veggie Burger / 4.8 / 14 mins / $9.99 / tags 320 kcal, Vegan, Plant Patty, image fill CFE0B5; Chicken Burger / 4.6 / 42 mins / $6.24 / tags 450 kcal, Low Fat, Grilled, fill E9D7BE; Fried Chicken Burger / 4.5 / 14 mins / $6.75 / tags 610 kcal, Spicy, Crunchy, fill EFC98D. Six of the eleven frames now exist; screens 07–11 are not started.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Build `07_Customize` next (x≈3180), reusing the product-page header pattern (back button + wordmark) plus the `AddOnItem` component (2009:141) for the topping options (Tomato/Cheese/Fries selected) and side options, the copy \"Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience\", quantity 2 with Total 2 × $8.24 = $16.48 in a bottom Order Now bar. This follows directly from the brief's frame list and the stated plan, e.g. my earlier note: \"My stated plan at that point: ... build all 11 frames with the exact required names in page 2006:2 (430 × 932 base viewport).\"\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/gaoyongyong/code/rate_website_figma-sft-cc-tap-benchmark-design/storage/benchmarks/3case-7models-v4-20261028/runs/TEST-013_1793204123667/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-gaoyongyong-code-rate-website-figma-sft-cc-tap-benchmark-design-storage-benchmarks-3case-7models-v4-20261028-workspace/3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a","uuid":"084b0f64-a8f6-45b1-ad22-aa4ee2f7426c","timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:39:04.467Z","isSynthetic":true}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_08d0f68f9756494ab0a50b0a3f2ac1fc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"/mnt/afs/panzhengyuan/llm_training/project/rate_website_figma-sft-cc-tap/storage/local-runtime/model-local-a282d9c9a73446c8/ckpt-270-shadow","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reasoning summary: 03 截图排版正常（图片、标签、评分、数量器、底部栏无重叠）。现在构建 07_Customize：复用产品页头部模式 + AddOnItem 组件（2009:141）做配料/配菜选项，含 2×$8.24=$16.48 底部栏。\n</think>\n</think>\n\n"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10759,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a","uuid":"26e31a24-3371-4486-9016-43257ba5a7a7","timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:40:44.097Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_08d0f68f9756494ab0a50b0a3f2ac1fc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"/mnt/afs/panzhengyuan/llm_training/project/rate_website_figma-sft-cc-tap/storage/local-runtime/model-local-a282d9c9a73446c8/ckpt-270-shadow","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_b44633069b86458c949f78a1","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2006:2'));\nconst hex=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255});\nconst S=(h,o)=>[{type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o}];\nfor(const s of ['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style:s});\nconst T=(t,sz,w,c,lh)=>{const n=figma.createText();n.fontName={family:'Roboto',style:w};n.characters=t;n.fontSize=sz;n.fills=S(c);if(lh)n.lineHeight={value:lh,unit:'PIXELS'};return n;};\nconst AF=(name,dir,gap,pad)=>{const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.layoutMode=dir;f.itemSpacing=gap;f.paddingTop=pad[0];f.paddingRight=pad[1];f.paddingBottom=pad[2];f.paddingLeft=pad[3];f.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';f.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';f.fills=[];f.clipsContent=false;return f;};\nconst RED='EF2A39',INK='3C2F2F',SUB='8C8282',BG='FDF9F7',PILL='F2EDEA',GOLD='F5A623',WHITE='FFFFFF';\nconst src=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2013:225');\nconst f=src.clone(); f.name='07_Customize'; f.x=3180; f.y=0;\nfor(const n of f.children.slice()) n.remove();\n\n// top bar\nconst bar=AF('topbar','HORIZONTAL',12,[10,16,10,16]); bar.fills=S(WHITE); bar.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nconst back=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:91');\nconst backWrap=figma.createFrame(); backWrap.name='Back'; backWrap.resize(36,36); backWrap.fills=S(BG); backWrap.cornerRadius=18; backWrap.clipsContent=false;\nconst bi=back.createInstance(); bi.rescale(20/24); bi.x=8; bi.y=8; backWrap.appendChild(bi); bar.appendChild(backWrap);\nconst title=T('Wendy’s Burger',18,'SemiBold',INK); bar.appendChild(title);\nconst sp=figma.createFrame(); sp.name='spacer'; sp.resize(10,10); sp.fills=[]; bar.appendChild(sp); sp.layoutGrow=1;\nconst step=T('Customize',13,'Medium',RED); bar.appendChild(step);\nf.appendChild(bar); bar.x=0; bar.y=0; bar.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n\n// content\nconst content=AF('content','VERTICAL',16,[14,16,16,16]); content.fills=S(BG); content.clipsContent=true;\nf.appendChild(content); content.x=0; content.y=bar.height; content.resize(430,932-bar.height-76);\ncontent.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL'; content.primaryAxisSizingMode='FIXED';\n\n// hero image + copy\nconst hero=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:32'); hero.fills=S('E4D3BC'); hero.rescale(160/hero.width); hero.cornerRadius=24;\ncontent.appendChild(hero); hero.layoutAlign='CENTER';\nconst head=AF('head','VERTICAL',6,[0,0,0,0]);\nconst h1=T('Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience',17,'SemiBold',INK,24); head.appendChild(h1); h1.layoutAlign='STRETCH'; h1.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';\nconst h2=T('Wendy’s Burger · 2 × $8.24',13,'Medium',SUB); head.appendChild(h2);\ncontent.appendChild(head); head.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n\n// add-on section builder using component 2009:141\nconst addOn=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2009:141');\nasync function section(titleTxt, items){\n  const sec=AF('section_'+titleTxt,'VERTICAL',10,[0,0,0,0]);\n  const hdr=AF('hdr','HORIZONTAL',8,[0,0,0,0]); hdr.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  hdr.appendChild(T(titleTxt,15,'SemiBold',INK));\n  const sub=T(items[3]||'',12,'Regular',SUB); hdr.appendChild(sub);\n  sec.appendChild(hdr);\n  const grid=AF('grid','HORIZONTAL',10,[0,0,0,0]); grid.layoutWrap='WRAP'; grid.counterAxisSpacing=10;\n  for(const it of items){\n    const n=addOn.createInstance(); n.name='AddOn_'+it[0]; n.resize(165,60);\n    const img=n.findOne(x=>x.type==='RECTANGLE'||x.type==='FRAME');\n    const label=n.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT');\n    if(label) label.characters=it[0]+'  '+it[1];\n    const toggle=n.findOne(x=>x.type==='FRAME'&&x.name!=='AddOnItem');\n    if(img) img.fills=S(it[2]);\n    if(toggle){ toggle.fills=S(it[3]==='on'?RED:PILL); if(toggle.children[0]){ toggle.children[0].fills=S(it[3]==='on'?WHITE:SUB); } }\n    grid.appendChild(n);\n  }\n  sec.appendChild(grid); grid.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n  content.appendChild(sec); sec.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n  return sec;\n}\nawait section('Toppings', [['Tomato','+free','F08A8A','on'],['Onions','+free','F2D8B8','off'],['Cheese','+$1.00','F5C64F','on'],['Pickles','+free','A9C48B','off']]);\nawait section('Sides', [['Fries','+$2.99','EFC98D','on'],['Coleslaw','+free','CFE0B5','off'],['Onion Rings','+$3.49','E4B87C','off'],['Salad','+free','BFE0C4','off']]);\n\n// quantity row\nconst qrow=AF('qty_row','HORIZONTAL',10,[10,14,10,14]); qrow.fills=S(WHITE); qrow.cornerRadius=16; qrow.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nqrow.appendChild(T('Quantity',14,'Medium',INK));\nconst sp2=figma.createFrame(); sp2.resize(10,10); sp2.fills=[]; qrow.appendChild(sp2); sp2.layoutGrow=1;\nconst minus=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:148'); const mi=minus.createInstance(); mi.rescale(18/24);\nconst qw=figma.createFrame(); qw.resize(28,28); qw.fills=S(BG); qw.cornerRadius=14; qw.clipsContent=false; const mi2=mi.clone(); mi2.x=5; mi2.y=5; qw.appendChild(mi2); qrow.appendChild(qw);\nconst qn=T('2',16,'SemiBold',INK); qrow.appendChild(qn);\nconst plus=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:145'); const pi=plus.createInstance(); pi.rescale(18/24);\nconst pw=figma.createFrame(); pw.resize(28,28); pw.fills=S(RED); pw.cornerRadius=14; pw.clipsContent=false; pi.x=5; pi.y=5; pw.appendChild(pi); qrow.appendChild(pw);\ncontent.appendChild(qrow); qrow.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n\n// bottom bar\nconst bb=AF('bottombar','HORIZONTAL',12,[16,16,16,16]); bb.fills=S(WHITE); bb.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nbb.strokes=S('EAE4E1'); bb.strokeWeight=1; bb.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nconst totalCol=AF('total','VERTICAL',2,[0,0,0,0]);\ntotalCol.appendChild(T('Total',12,'Regular',SUB));\ntotalCol.appendChild(T('2 × $8.24 = $16.48',17,'Bold',INK));\nbb.appendChild(totalCol);\nconst sp3=figma.createFrame(); sp3.resize(10,10); sp3.fills=[]; bb.appendChild(sp3); sp3.layoutGrow=1;\nconst btn=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:2'); const b=btn.createInstance(); b.resize(180,52);\nconst bl=b.findOne(x=>x.type==='TEXT'); if(bl) bl.characters='Order Now · $16.48';\nbb.appendChild(b);\nf.appendChild(bb); bb.layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'; bb.resize(430,bb.height); bb.x=0; bb.y=932-bb.height;\n\nconst hi=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:19'); const h=hi.createInstance(); f.appendChild(h); h.x=0; h.y=898;\nreturn {id:f.id,name:f.name,h:f.height,bottombarH:bb.height,contentH:content.height};\n","description":"Build 07_Customize frame: header, hero copy, Toppings/Sides add-on chips via AddOnItem component, quantity row, bottom total bar","fileKey":"w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR","skillNames":"resource:figma-use"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10759,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a","uuid":"3ba5d611-c275-4aed-8c0a-1df7f450d48d","timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:40:44.099Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_b44633069b86458c949f78a1","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
