{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user's single Chinese-language request: 请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计 — complete the full design in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR/ (fileKey `w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR`). Read the task in 「00·Start Here」, follow the visual spec in 「01·Foundations」, reuse components from 「02·Components」, use assets from 「04·Media」, and deliver the complete design into 「03·Workspace」.\n\n   Harness constraints (must remain in force): confirm account via whoami before writing (must be gaoyongyong@tetras.ai); use only the assigned file; read reference pages before writing; create all work inside page `2006:2` (create if missing) and preserve existing reference pages; do not create another Figma file or switch accounts/teams; build in manageable sections and check tool results before continuing; add prototype interactions after the relevant screens exist; inspect screenshots of all required screens and fix visible problems; finish with the file URL, the 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and any remaining limitations; do not claim completion for unfinished work. Every tool call must be preceded in the same assistant message by a visible summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; the final response must start with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:`. This is an unattended session — resolve routine choices from the brief without waiting for a human answer.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma MCP tools: `whoami`, `get_metadata`, `use_figma` (JavaScript against Figma Plugin API), `get_screenshot`.\n   - Plugin API: `figma.setCurrentPageAsync`, `figma.getNodeByIdAsync`, `node.clone()`, `createInstance()`, `rescale()`, `findOne`/`findAll`, `figma.loadFontAsync`, `layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'`.\n   - Critical: food/brand images in `_Library Assets` are **RECTANGLE** clones — must `.clone()` + set fills, never `createInstance()`. Icon components (24×24) and UI components must use `createInstance()`.\n   - Critical lesson this session: any child of an auto-layout frame must be given `layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'` or it enters the layout flow (the 09 Home Indicator bug).\n   - Clone-shell pattern: `const src = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2013:225'); const f = src.clone(); f.name=...; f.x=...; for(const n of f.children.slice()) n.remove();`\n   - Design tokens: RED `EF2A39`, INK `3C2F2F`, SUB `8C8282`, BG `FDF9F7`, GOLD `F5A623`, WHITE `FFFFFF`, LINE `EAE4E1`, PILL `F2EDEA`, highlight bg `FFF1F0`. Viewport 430×932.\n   - Fonts: Roboto Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold for all UI text; Lobster only inside supplied wordmark components.\n   - Helper functions reused in every build call:\n     ```js\n     const hex=h=>({r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255});\n     const S=(h,o)=>[{type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o}];\n     const T=(t,sz,w,c,lh)=>{const n=figma.createText();n.fontName={family:'Roboto',style:w};n.characters=t;n.fontSize=sz;n.fills=S(c);if(lh)n.lineHeight={value:lh,unit:'PIXELS'};return n;};\n     const AF=(name,dir,gap,pad)=>{const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.layoutMode=dir;f.itemSpacing=gap;f.paddingTop=pad[0];f.paddingRight=pad[1];f.paddingBottom=pad[2];f.paddingLeft=pad[3];f.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO';f.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';f.fills=[];f.clipsContent=false;return f;};\n     const spacer=()=>{const s=figma.createFrame();s.name='spacer';s.resize(10,10);s.fills=[];return s;}; // then s.layoutGrow=1\n     ```\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   This task writes to a Figma file, not local files. Artifacts in page `2006:2`:\n   - `_Library Assets` frame `2008:156` — 43 cloned source assets.\n   - Icon COMPONENTs (24×24): Home `2008:47`, User `2008:53`, Chat `2008:60`, Heart `2008:67`, Search `2008:74`, Filter `2008:82`, Back `2008:91`, ChevronRight `2008:95`, Star `2008:100`, Settings `2008:106`, Lock `2008:111`, Edit `2008:116`, SignOut `2008:127`, Send `2008:137`, Plus `2008:145`, Minus `2008:148`, Check `2008:150`, Menu `2008:153`.\n   - UI COMPONENTs: Button `2008:2` (label child is TEXT), Text Field `2008:4`, Status Bar `2008:8` (430×44), Home Indicator `2008:19` (430×34), Wordmark Dark `2008:21`, Wordmark White `2008:23`, Avatar_Neutral `2008:25` (120×120).\n   - RECTANGLE images (clone only): Burger_Cheeseburger_Wendys `2008:28`, Burger_Veggie `2008:29`, Burger_Chicken `2008:30`, Burger_Fried_Chicken `2008:31`, Burger_Exploded_Custom `2008:32`, Toppings `2008:33–2008:39`, Sides `2008:40–2008:44`, Card_Mastercard `2008:45`, Card_Visa `2008:46`.\n   - Session-created components: BottomNav/Home `2009:42`, BottomNav/Profile `2009:83`, BottomNav/Support `2009:124` (430×76), Rating `2009:133`, AddOnItem `2009:141` (165×60; children `[\"thumb:FRAME\",\"Tomato:TEXT\",\"toggle:FRAME\"]`).\n   - Frames now built (11 total): `01_Splash` 2012:84 (x=0), `02_Home` 2012:114 (x=530), `03_Product_Cheeseburger` 2013:225 (x=1060), `04_Product_Veggie` 2016:262 (x=1590), `05_Product_Chicken` 2016:337 (x=2120), `06_Product_Fried_Chicken` 2016:412 (x=2650), `07_Customize` 2018:373 (x=3180), `08_Payment` 2019:429 (x=3710), `09_Payment_Success_Overlay` 2020:436 (x=4240), `10_Profile` 2023:446 (x=4770), `11_Support_Chat` 2024:562 (x=5300).\n   - 09-specific node IDs: Success_Modal (378×466 at y=233), Scrim (430×932 #1A1010 65%), Home Indicator `2020:509`.\n   - Most recent code (11_Support_Chat bubble builder, succeeded):\n     ```js\n     async function bubble(side,txt,time){\n       const row=AF('msg_'+(side==='bot'?'bot':'user'),'HORIZONTAL',8,[0,0,0,0]);\n       row.primaryAxisAlignItems=side==='bot'?'MIN':'MAX'; row.counterAxisAlignItems='MIN';\n       const col=AF('col','VERTICAL',4,[0,0,0,0]); col.counterAxisAlignItems=side==='bot'?'MIN':'MAX';\n       const b=AF('bubble','VERTICAL',0,[10,14,10,14]);\n       b.fills=S(side==='bot'?WHITE:RED); b.cornerRadius=16;\n       if(side==='bot'){b.strokes=S(LINE); b.strokeWeight=1;}\n       const t=T(txt,13,'Regular',side==='bot'?INK:WHITE,20); b.appendChild(t);\n       b.resize(Math.min(272,Math.max(90,t.width+28)),b.height); t.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL'; t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';\n       col.appendChild(b); col.appendChild(T(time,10,'Regular',SUB));\n       if(side==='bot'){ const av=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2008:25')).clone(); av.rescale(30/120); row.appendChild(av); row.appendChild(col); }\n       else { row.appendChild(col); }\n       msgs.appendChild(row); row.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n     }\n     ```\n     Result: `{id:\"2024:562\",name:\"11_Support_Chat\",msgCount:8,inputY:778,barH:54}`.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - `set_characters: Property \"characters\" failed validation: Expected string, received array` (07_Customize, first attempt): in `section()` I passed `items[3]` (an item tuple array) as the subtitle string. Fixed by changing the signature to `section(titleTxt, subtitle, items)` and passing literal strings `'choose any'` / `'pick one'`; also deleted the partial `07_Customize` before rebuilding.\n   - `node.createInstance: no such property 'createInstance' on RECTANGLE node` (10_Profile, first attempt): I passed `'2008:45'` (Card_Mastercard, a RECTANGLE) as an icon component ID in `item()`. Fixed by using icon component `2008:95` for the \"Payment Details\" row and putting `'Mastercard **** 0505'` in the right-side text instead; deleted the partial `10_Profile` and rebuilt.\n   - Layout bug found by screenshot of 09_Payment_Success_Overlay: the Home Indicator rendered at y≈166 (in the auto-layout flow) instead of at the bottom. Cause: in 08_Payment the home indicator was appended without `layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'`, and cloning inherited that. Fixed with:\n     ```js\n     const hi=f.findOne(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Home Indicator')>=0);\n     hi.layoutPositioning='ABSOLUTE'; hi.x=0; hi.y=898;\n     ```\n     Before: `y=852, pos=AUTO`; after: `y=898, pos=ABSOLUTE`. Also discovered 09 had no Status Bar instance (`sbInfo: null`), so a Status Bar (2008:8) was appended absolutely at (0,0) during the 10_Profile build call.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Established a consistent screen template: clone 2013:225 as a clean shell, wipe children, then compose absolute-positioned topbar / content column / bottom bar / bottom nav / home indicator.\n   - Solved overlay page construction by cloning the finished 08_Payment (renaming its children `08_Payment_*`, changing `'2 of 3'`→`'3 of 3'` and `'Pay Now'`→`'Paying…'`), then layering a Scrim and a centered Success_Modal on top.\n   - Confirmed via screenshots that 03, 07, 08 render cleanly (no overlaps, correct selected/unselected card states, correct totals).\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计: Figma 文件:https://www.figma.com/design/w8cdABfIOMXOTNZPXNSZhR/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n   - (Final turn) A system-level instruction to respond with TEXT ONLY and produce this summary without calling tools.\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Screenshot and verify `10_Profile` (2023:446) and `11_Support_Chat` (2024:562); also still unverified this session: `04_Product_Veggie` (2016:262), `05_Product_Chicken` (2016:337), `06_Product_Fried_Chicken` (2016:412).\n   - Apply the two earlier polish fixes: (a) Splash chevron icon sits slightly right of centre inside its circle; (b) Home menu-card rows slightly cramped below the wrapped description text.\n   - Add all prototype reactions: Splash→Home (auto); Home items→03–06; Home Profile tab→10, Support tab→11; product back→Home; 03 Order Now→07; 07 back→03, Order Now→08; 08 back→07, Pay Now→09; 09 Go Back→Home; 10 back→Home; 11 back→Home.\n   - Final response: file URL, page ID 2006:2, frame IDs, prototype work completed, limitations (including the Splash_Burger_Stack substitution noted earlier).\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Immediately before the summary request, the last tool call successfully built `11_Support_Chat` (id `2024:562`, x=5300) — the 11th and final required frame — returning `{\"id\":\"2024:562\",\"name\":\"11_Support_Chat\",\"msgCount\":8,\"inputY\":778,\"barH\":54}`. It contains the 'Today' stamp plus the 7 required messages in order: user \"Hi, I ordered a Wendy's Burger but the delivery is running late.\" (26 minutes ago); bot \"Hello Sophia! I'm sorry to hear that. Let me check the status of order #WEN-2026-10482 for you.\" (26 minutes ago); user \"It shows delivered, but nobody has arrived at my door.\" (25 minutes ago); bot \"I can see the rider marked it delivered at 12:42. Could you check with your neighbours or building desk?\" (25 minutes ago); user \"No luck, nothing was left. Can I get a refund?\" (24 minutes ago); bot \"Of course. I've filed a claim and you'll receive a full refund of $18.28 to your Mastercard within 3–5 business days.\" (24 minutes ago); user \"Thank you, that helps a lot.\" (23 minutes ago) — plus a Text Field placeholder \"Type your message…\" with a red Send button at y=778, and BottomNav/Support (2009:124) at y=856 with the Home Indicator at y=898. All 11 frames now exist, but 10 and 11 have not yet been screenshot-verified.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Take screenshots of `10_Profile` (2023:446) and `11_Support_Chat` (2024:562) to verify their layouts (checking in particular that the chat bubbles/messages column and the Profile header/lists do not overflow or overlap the input bar and bottom nav), then proceed to the remaining pending work — the two polish fixes and all prototype reactions — before writing the final answer. This follows directly from the harness rule \"Inspect screenshots of all required screens. You may take multiple screenshots, fix visible problems and check again.\"\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/gaoyongyong/code/rate_website_figma-sft-cc-tap-benchmark-design/storage/benchmarks/3case-7models-v4-20261028/runs/TEST-013_1793204123667/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-gaoyongyong-code-rate-website-figma-sft-cc-tap-benchmark-design-storage-benchmarks-3case-7models-v4-20261028-workspace/3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c94e7b6-88a3-4132-a2c7-0ee43de68f6a","uuid":"0b17e353-03c5-4e8b-bccf-f78d8a722aea","timestamp":"2026-10-28T16:57:56.085Z","isSynthetic":true}
